e}], "final_answer": "The Can de Palleiro, also known as the Galician shepherd dog or Pastor Galego, is a dog breed originating in Galicia (Spain). It is closely associated with the historical Kingdom of Galicia, which was located in southwestern Europe and encompassed the northwest of the Iberian Peninsula.", "total_time": 76.54096221923828, "retrieval_rounds": 2}, "question_id": "5ae0b7cf554299603e418446", "prompt_tokens": 11671, "completion_tokens": 2948, "total_tokens": 14619, "llm_call_count": 3, "total_llm_latency_seconds": 76.4082, "mean_llm_call_latency_seconds": 25.4694}
