cess": true}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T23:12:50.518923", "agent_role": "Analysis-Answer", "input_data": {"sub_question": "Was there a film made about The strongest recorded tropical cyclone is the 1999 Odisha cyclone (also known as Cyclone Bob 03), which had peak winds of 260 km/h (160 mph) and a record-low pressure of 912 mbar (26.93 inhg). in 2007?", "num_documents": 3}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "{\n  \"status\": \"yes\",\n  \"answer\": \"Yes, a film titled 'Kathantara' (English: 'Another Story') was made in 2007 about the 1999 Odisha cyclone. It is an Indian Oriya language disaster film directed by Himansu Khatua, depicting the tribulations caused by the cyclone.\",\n  \"analysis\": \"The retrieved documents explicitly mention 'Kathantara' as a 2007 film based on the 1999 Odisha cyclone. This directly answers the sub-question about the existence of a 2007 film related to the cyclone.\"\n}", "parsed_result": {"status": "yes", "answer": "Yes, a film titled 'Kathantara' (English: 'Another Story') was made in 2007 about the 1999 Odisha cyclone. It is an Indian Oriya language disaster film directed by Himansu Khatua, depicting the tribulations caused by the cyclone.", "analysis": "The retrieved documents explicitly mention 'Kathantara' as a 2007 film based on the 1999 Odisha cyclone. This directly answers the sub-question about the existence of a 2007 film related to the cyclone."}}, "reasoning_process": "Analyzing documents for: Was there a film made about The strongest recorded tropical cyclone is the 1999 Odisha cyclone (also known as Cyclone Bob 03), which had peak winds of 260 km/h (160 mph) and a record-low pressure of 912 mbar (26.93 inhg). in 2007?", "retrieval_info": null, "success": true}], "final_answer": "Yes, a film titled 'Kathantara' (English: 'Another Story') was made in 2007 about the 1999 Odisha cyclone. It is an Indian Oriya language disaster film directed by Himansu Khatua, depicting the tribulations caused by the cyclone.", "total_time": 3