al revolution from 1945 to 1949.?", "num_documents": 5}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "{\n  \"status\": \"yes\",\n  \"answer\": \"The Dutch Empire\",\n  \"analysis\": \"The documents explicitly mention the Indonesian national revolution (1945-1949) as an armed conflict between the Republic of Indonesia and the Dutch Empire. This directly identifies the Dutch Empire as the opponent during the period Nugroho Notosusanto served in the Student Army. While other political groups (e.g., PKI) are referenced in later contexts (1965 coup), the specific historical context of the 1945-1949 revolution clearly frames the Dutch as the primary opponent.\"\n}", "parsed_result": {"status": "yes", "answer": "The Dutch Empire", "analysis": "The documents explicitly mention the Indonesian national revolution (1945-1949) as an armed conflict between the Republic of Indonesia and the Dutch Empire. This directly identifies the Dutch Empire as the opponent during the period Nugroho Notosusanto served in the Student Army. While other political groups (e.g., PKI) are referenced in later contexts (1965 coup), the specific historical context of the 1945-1949 revolution clearly frames the Dutch as the primary opponent."}}, "reasoning_process": "Analyzing documents for: Who was the opponent of the Republican of Indenosia during Nugroho Notosusanto served as a member of the Student Army during the Indonesian national revolution from 1945 to 1949.?", "retrieval_info": null, "success": true}], "final_answer": "The Dutch Empire", "total_time": 40.04794526100159, "retrieval_rounds": 2}, "question_id": "5a7b22f8554299042af8f6ff", "prompt_tokens": 12414, "completion_tokens": 1473, "total_tokens": 13887, "llm_call_count": 3, "total_llm_latency_seconds": 39.8869, "mean_llm_call_latency_seconds": 13.2956}
