iff, confirming it as the coastal town in question."}}, "reasoning_process": "Analyzing documents for: What coastal town in Australia was the location of On 4 May 1982, Australian Army personnel Robin Reid and Paul Luckman kidnapped teenage boys Peter Aston and Terry Ryan on the Gold Coast, Queensland. They drove the boys at gun and knife point to Kingscliff, New South Wales, where they were beaten, tortured, and sexually assaulted. Peter Aston was ultimately murdered in the incident.?", "retrieval_info": null, "success": true}], "final_answer": "Kingscliff", "total_time": 62.762484550476074, "retrieval_rounds": 2}, "question_id": "5ac15c1c5542994ab5c67cf7", "prompt_tokens": 12076, "completion_tokens": 2389, "total_tokens": 14465, "llm_call_count": 3, "total_llm_latency_seconds": 62.5861, "mean_llm_call_latency_seconds": 20.862}
